{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":5,"exerciseID":"056TC7vxiOnFhWiOf3O","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":8,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"八年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)证明详见解析(2)证明详见解析(3)证明详见解析","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5dfb10f4279336deaa1568f4","queId":"056TC7vxiOnFhWiOf3O","schCode":"3035","textbookId":"5dfada3c0248369c447d5ac7"}],"question":"如图，在四边形ABDC中，∠D=∠B=90°，O为BD的中点，且AO平分∠BAC.求证：<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/183874d7cf601f0.png\">(1)CO平分∠ACD;(2)OA⊥OC;(3)AB+CD =AC.","solution":"(1)如图，过点O作OE上AC于点E.∵∠B=90°，AO平分∠BAC,∴OB=OE.∵点O为BD的中点，∴OB=OD.∴OE=OD.又∵∠D=90°，∠OEC=90°，∴CO平分∠ACD.(2)在Rt△ABO和Rt△AEO中，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1838750012a01f1.png\">∴Rt△ABO≌Rt△AEO(HL).<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18387504d2c01fk.png\">同理，<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18387507c6101f4.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/18387509b5601f2.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1838750cec801fl.png\"><img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1838750ea2901f5.png\">(3)∵Rt△ABO≌Rt△AEO,∴AB=AE.同理可得CD=CE.∵AE+CE=AC,∴AB+CD=AC.<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/quesbank/v3Images/2022/1838751fbe601fm.png\">","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":0,"knowId":"5ec34b8d518ec3c65e1e8b58","knowName":"全等三角形的判定定理HL","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df22","knowTypeName":"知识点","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":1,"queId":"056TC7vxiOnFhWiOf3O","sortIndex":658},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5ec34c09518ec3c65e1e8b60","knowName":"利用全等三角形的性质证明角、线段相等","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"056TC7vxiOnFhWiOf3O","sortIndex":666}]}